{"t":"MP","made":"2026-11-20 01:31","name":"MP Materials Corp.","ko":"MP머티리얼즈","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Other Industrial Metals & Mining","employees":998,"hq":"Las Vegas, NV, United States","website":"https://mpmaterials.com","summary_en":"MP Materials Corp., together with its subsidiaries, produces rare earth materials in the Western Hemisphere. It operates in two segments, Materials and Magnetics. The Materials segment owns and operates the Mountain Pass Rare Earth Mine and Processing facility located near Mountain Pass, San Bernardino County, California. The Magnetics segment produces magnetic precursor products, including NdPr metal; and manufactures NdFeB permanent magnets. MP Materials Corp. was founded in 2017 and is headquartered in Las Vegas, Nevada.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"MP Materials Corp.는 자회사와 함께 서반구에서 희토류 재료를 생산합니다. 재료와 자기학이라는 두 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 재료 부문은 캘리포니아주 샌버나디노 카운티 마운틴패스 근처에 위치한 마운틴패스 희토류 광산 및 처리 시설을 소유하고 운영합니다. 자기 부문은 NdPr 금속을 포함한 자기 전구체 제품을 생산합니다. NdFeB 영구자석을 제조하고 있습니다. MP Materials Corp.는 2017년에 설립되었으며 네바다주 라스베이거스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":37.23,"mcap":6636916224.0,"pe":null,"fpe":94.038895,"peg":null,"ps":12.801286,"pb":3.4027967,"ev_ebitda":103.781,"div":0.0,"beta":2.108,"hi52":76.8,"lo52":31.9},"fin":{"rev":518456992.0,"rev_g":1.909,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.46530998,"op":-0.12724,"net":-0.07628,"roe":-0.01668,"fcf":-410353376.0,"cash":1337911040.0,"debt":983617024.0,"de":41.613,"eps":-0.2,"feps":0.3959},"own":{"short":0.2183,"inst":0.78523004,"insider":0.19669001},"analyst":{"n":16,"mean":65.9375,"median":62.5,"high":100.0,"low":40.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.26316,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":14,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":13,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":5,"buy":13,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":13,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes"